00:10:15.567 --> 00:10:19.133
and then, from there,
you just tap to the side.

00:10:19.133 --> 00:10:21.567
But you use this arm
almost like a windmill.

00:10:21.567 --> 00:10:22.667
-A windmill. Okay. Ready?

00:10:22.667 --> 00:10:24.200
