can be almost like

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:25.234
you're holding a cane
or something.

00:10:25.234 --> 00:10:26.267
-Okay.

00:10:26.267 --> 00:10:28.267
-So you're kind of
from the side.

00:10:31.033 --> 00:10:34.400
-That's why he's the best.

